        "r": 531.3200000000002,
        "b": 708.7
      },
      "content": "Disconnect three connectors (callout 1), pass the wire harnesses and cables through the opening in the cover (callout 2), and then release them from the retainers (callout 3)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_4752",
      "reading_order": 6590,
      "section": "13. Remove the right cover.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 135.0,
        "t": 696.79,
        "r": 473.8899999999999,
        "b": 685.2
      },
      "content": "NOTE: One cable (callout 4) does not need to pass through the opening in the cover."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_4753",
      "reading_order": 6591,
      "section": "13. Remove the right cover.",
      "bbox": {
